            "review_title": "Review at POC Beers & Grills",
            "review_text": "Truc P\n69 contributions\n0\nDelicious local cuisine next to center\nJul 2019\nThe location is next to city center, just went over a long bridge. Our group of 4 took a taxi from the center and it took ~10 minutes for less than 4 miles. The restaurant were delightful and attractive like an open pub with TVs for sport / fashion... Many choices of local beer from industrial to craft ones, we selected some crafts and they were worthy. Food was really local flavor and it was delicious. Many choices of grilled dishes are from beef, pork, chicken, fish, scallop ... Staffs are very friendly and helpful; when we asked for a iphone charger, they helped us out with one. It was amazing and we will come back to enjoy other tasty dishes.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 19, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
